    {
      "id": "MJUe",
      "code_hash": "d3732219c8227ecd7c0827230480320b",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"generate-synthetic-queries-for-rag-evaluation\">Generate Synthetic Queries for RAG Evaluation</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Goal:</strong> Create evaluation queries with ground truth for testing BM25 retrieval.</span>\n<h2 id=\"the-two-step-process\">The Two-Step Process:</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Extract Salient Facts</strong> - Pull out specific cooking details (temps, times, techniques)</li>\n<li><strong>Generate Queries</strong> - Create natural questions that these facts can answer</li>\n</ol>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">This gives us:</span>\n<ul>\n<li>A synthetic query (the question)</li>\n<li>Ground truth (which recipe should be retrieved)</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "bkHC",
      "code_hash": "07b9a553e2d8c2b1d96ed804717ac381",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"step-1-extract-salient-facts\">Step 1: Extract Salient Facts</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">First, we'll create a prompt to extract specific, searchable facts from recipes.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">We want facts like:</span>\n<ul>\n<li>\"Bake at 350\u00b0F for 25 minutes\"</li>\n<li>\"Marinate chicken for 4 hours\"</li>\n<li>\"Whisk eggs until soft peaks form\"</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "PKri",
      "code_hash": "af949973dfeb75511a5a023780e0c65f",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"step-2-generate-query-from-fact\">Step 2: Generate Query from Fact</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Next, we'll create a prompt to turn facts into natural user queries.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SFPL",
      "code_hash": "617d11478c3499936214fcc9eee03da5",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"test-on-a-single-recipe\">Test on a Single Recipe</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Let's test our prompts on one recipe before processing all 200.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "nWHF",
      "code_hash": "144957d49b5a74a940f75cb9c6ca4de4",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"reflection-before-proceeding\">\ud83e\udd14 Reflection Before Proceeding</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Before we generate queries for all 200 recipes, think about:</span>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Is the extracted fact specific enough?</strong> Would someone actually search for this?</li>\n<li><strong>Is the query natural?</strong> Does it sound like something a real person would ask?</li>\n<li><strong>Can this recipe answer the query?</strong> Is there a clear connection?</li>\n</ol>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">If the test looks good, scroll down to process all recipes!</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "iLit",
      "code_hash": "b4f1bb623fe29f8bd5abfc3099696048",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"generate-queries-for-all-200-recipes\">Generate Queries for All 200 Recipes</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Now we'll process all recipes. This will:</span>\n<ol>\n<li>Extract a salient fact from each recipe</li>\n<li>Generate a natural query from that fact</li>\n<li>Save the results with ground truth</li>\n</ol>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>This will take a few minutes and cost ~<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(0.50-||)</marimo-tex>1.00 in API calls.</strong></span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
