            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"test-results\">\u2705 Test Results</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Recipe:</strong> 5 cheese crab lasagna with roasted garlic and vegetables</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Salient Fact Extracted:</strong></span>\n<blockquote>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Roast whole garlic heads wrapped in foil at 375\u00b0F for 40-45 minutes until tender when pierced.</span>\n</blockquote>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Generated Query:</strong></span>\n<blockquote>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">How long do I roast whole garlic heads?</span>\n</blockquote>\n<hr />\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Does this look good?</strong></span>\n<ul>\n<li>Is the fact specific and searchable?</li>\n<li>Does the query sound natural?</li>\n<li>Would this recipe answer the query?</li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">If yes, we're ready to process all recipes!</span></span>"
